    "_medium": "A domain may declare what it serves. detect.js puts it on the entry so a light novel is filed as one without anybody correcting it by hand, and the tracker is told episodes or chapters accordingly. Absent means manga, which is what every entry in this file was until now. It is data and not code on purpose: a site that turns out to be something else costs a line here, not a release.",
